OL,3,GNEWSAMeadows get protection to buy time
OL,4,Aafter sale bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA country park in Worcestershire has
OL,7,Fbeen given new protection from an
OL,8,Fimmediate sale after being listed as an
OL,9,FAsset of Community Value (ACV).
OL,11,FIt comes after Wyre Forest District
OL,12,FCouncil's Cabinet agreed in principle
OL,13,Fto the proposed sale of part of Burlish
OL,14,FCountry Park (Burlish Meadows) to
OL,15,FKidderminster Harriers Football Club.
OL,17,FThe protection of the land, near
OL,18,FStourport-on-Severn, means the council
OL,19,Fmust give the community an opportunity
OL,20,Fto bid for the land before any sale can
OL,21,Fproceed.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
